<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your {{ brand_name }} account has been deleted</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; background: #f9f9f9; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    p { line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo">{{ brand_name }}</div>
    <p>Hi {{ display_name }},</p>
    <p>
      Your {{ brand_name }} account has been permanently deleted as requested. All your
      personal data has been removed from our systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      We're sorry to see you go. If you ever want to rejoin, you're always
      welcome to create a new account.
    </p>
    <p>Take care,</p>
    <p>— The {{ brand_name }} team</p>
    <div class="footer">
      This is a final confirmation that your {{ brand_name }} account has been deleted.
      No further emails will be sent to this address.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
